{{!
    @template local_ai_course_assistant/soapbox_result

    Rubric scores for one Soapbox run, rendered by amd/src/soapbox.js through
    core/templates (CONTRIB-10574 #278). It replaces the innerHTML string the
    inline script used to concatenate.

    Everything here is model-supplied text, so every value is rendered through a
    plain double-brace variable rather than a triple-brace one: Mustache escapes
    it, which is what replaces the hand-rolled escaper the old inline script ran
    before concatenating innerHTML. There is no triple-brace output in this
    template.

    The not-assessed branch mirrors the stored-score table in soapbox.mustache.
    A criterion the model reported it could not judge is excluded from the total
    by compute_overall(), so showing its raw 0 here would tell the learner one
    thing and the saved attempt another. The caller sets `assessed` false only
    on an explicit false, so undefined, null, 0, "0" and "" all count as
    assessed, exactly as rubric_manager::is_assessed() counts them in PHP.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * criteria - rows, each with: name, assessed, score, feedback
    * overall - overall comment, empty when the model returned none
    * hastips - true when tips is non-empty
    * tips - list of {text} coaching tips

    Example context (json):
    {
        "criteria": [
            {"name": "Structure", "assessed": true, "score": 4,
             "feedback": "Clear signposting between points."},
            {"name": "Delivery", "assessed": false, "score": 0,
             "feedback": "No audio evidence for this criterion."}
        ],
        "overall": "A confident take that needs a stronger close.",
        "hastips": true,
        "tips": [{"text": "Land your last sentence instead of trailing off."}]
    }
}}
<div class="card"><div class="card-body">
    <h3>{{#str}}soapbox:result_heading, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}</h3>
    <table class="generaltable sola-soapbox-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>{{#str}}soapbox:col_criterion, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}</th>
                <th class="sola-soapbox-live-col-score">
                    {{#str}}soapbox:col_score, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}
                </th>
                <th>{{#str}}soapbox:col_feedback, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {{#criteria}}
            <tr class="{{^assessed}}text-muted{{/assessed}}">
                <td>{{name}}</td>
                <td class="sola-soapbox-score">
                    {{#assessed}}{{score}}{{/assessed}}
                    {{^assessed}}<span class="badge badge-secondary">{{#str}}soapbox:not_assessed, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}</span><span class="accesshide"> {{#str}}soapbox:not_assessed_aria, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}</span>{{/assessed}}
                </td>
                <td>{{feedback}}</td>
            </tr>
            {{/criteria}}
        </tbody>
    </table>
    {{#overall}}
    <h4 class="mt-3">{{#str}}soapbox:overall_heading, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}</h4>
    <p>{{overall}}</p>
    {{/overall}}
    {{#hastips}}
    <h4 class="mt-2">{{#str}}soapbox:tips_heading, local_ai_course_assistant{{/str}}</h4>
    <ol>
        {{#tips}}
        <li>{{text}}</li>
        {{/tips}}
    </ol>
    {{/hastips}}
</div></div>
